<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Glasscode: third-party notices</title>
<style>
body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; color: #111; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; }
h3 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>Glasscode is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE.txt, NOTICE.txt). Its programs
contain the Rust packages below. Each is listed with its licence; the fonts have theirs in the
folder <code>licenses</code>.</p>
<h2>Licences</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Packages and licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{#if crate.repository}}<a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{else}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
